      "message": "Gemini feedback:\n\n----\n\nIn `DownloadBin`, you check whether the target address is a configuration page multiple times:\n\n```c\nif (target_addr \u003d\u003d kBootCfgAddr || target_addr \u003d\u003d kRomCfgAddr) { ... }\n\n```\n\n**Improvement:** Hoist this out into a local boolean flag at the top of the function. It makes the subsequent logic much easier to read:\n\n```c\nconst bool is_config_update \u003d (target_addr \u003d\u003d kBootCfgAddr || target_addr \u003d\u003d kRomCfgAddr);\n\n// ...\n\nif (is_config_update) {\n  FT_LOGI(\"Write config page last\");\n  // ...\n}\n\n```",
